  "header": {
    "id": "productionSetupOperator",
    "name": "ProductionSetupOperator",
    "description": "Defines the operator assignments and labor requirements for a specific workunit during active production. This model tracks which users are assigned to operate equipment and their labor allocation weights for accurate cost accounting.\n\nOperator records in this table are created, when a user is badged into a work unit. Upon badging out of the work unit, the record is deleted. These activities are also tracked in the Operator History model for historial purposes.",
